><p>Comparison of reconstructed images from three-dimensional simulations.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="IJBI2008-769195.007"/></fig><fig id="fig8" position="float"><label>Figure 8</label><caption><p>Predicted and measured errors for three-dimensional simulations.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="IJBI2008-769195.008"/></fig><fig id="fig9" position="float"><label>Figure 9</label><caption><p>Illustration of line used for profile comparison.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="IJBI2008-769195.009"/></fig><fig id="fig10" position="float"><label>Figure 10</label><caption><p>Comparisonof system profiles for (a) original phantom, (b) system A, (c) system C, and(d) system E.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="IJBI2008-769195.010"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>